# meta-nedap-linux-mixin

Yocto Project mixin layer for shared Nedap build components. It currently
provides the `linux-nedap` mainline stable-kernel baseline for Wrynose.

`linux-nedap_6.18.bb` pins both the exact Linux stable release and its
source commit. Hardware BSP layers add their defconfig, device tree, and patch
series through `linux-nedap` bbappends; product layers add product policy in
the same way.

The layer depends on OpenEmbedded-Core (`core`) and is compatible with
Wrynose. It should be listed after OE-Core and before the Nedap BSP and
product layers.
